web_scroll:
Scroll the page (or focused scroll container) using simple direction semantics.

Use this instead of raw `browser_mouse_wheel` deltas.

Arguments:
- direction: "down" or "up"
- amount: pixels per step (default 420)
- steps: number of steps (default 1)
- settle_ms: wait after each step (default 120)
- capture_snapshot: include browser_snapshot after scrolling (default true)

